SUMMARY:Riftbound Vendetta Pre-Rift Pre-Release Event
DTSTAMP:20260713T123608Z
DTSTART:20260724T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:⚔️ Join CCS and Omega Gaming for the Riftbound: Vendetta Pre-Rif
	t Pre-Release! Be among the first to crack open the new set\, learn the la
	test cards and mechanics\, and battle alongside fellow players before the 
	official release. Spots are limited\, so secure your seat and prepare for 
	Vendetta!\nCapped at 32 players\, so enter while supplies last! \n  \n🗓️ : 
	July 24\, 2026 \n📍: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nE
	vent Overview: \n\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss Rounds\nExp
