UID:bWYC3JrFvIvg1u1Fhhrmu
SUMMARY:Houston World of Hot Wheels IV
DTSTAMP:20260713T123608Z
DTSTART:20260725T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🚗🏁 Houston World of Hot Wheels IV is roaring back with more thr
	ills and speed! 🏁🚗\nAfter an electric\, action-packed weekend of nonstop d
	eals\, racing\, and collector excitement\, Houston World of Hot Wheels IV 
	is revving up for another round! We’re bringing even MORE vendors\, MORE c
	ars\, and MORE action for collectors\, racers\, and families to enjoy all 
	weekend long. ⚡ \n  \n📅 July 25–26\, 2026 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 
	1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \nEvent Highlights\n🛒
	 Hot Wheels Swap & Shop – Both Days \n50+ vendors. 30\,000+ Hot Wheels\, M
	atchbox\, and diecast to dig through. STHs\, TH variations\, premium Car C
	ulture\, redline-era pieces\, MOC vintage\, loose mainline bins\, M2s\, Gr
	eenlights\, Johnny Lightnings. Bring your want list! \n🚗✨ Houston Diecast 
	Custom Contest – 10AM-3PM | Both Days \nCalling all builders and custom ki
	ngs 👑 Bring your best custom Hot Wheels/Matchbox build — paint\, wheel swa
	ps\, stance\, body kits\, full one-of-one creations. This contest is for t
	he detail freaks and the true “trust the process” customizers. 🏆 The winne
	r will be announced at 4PM and will receive a prize sponsored by Domingo! 
	✨ Hosted by @funopolistoys \n🏁 Hot Wheels Racing Contest – Both Days\nThe 
	stage track is live all weekend. Hourly races\, prizes for winners\, FREE 
	to enter. Saturday at 12PM\, 2PM\, and 4PM. Sunday Every hour from 11AM – 
	4PM. ✨ Hosted by Kool Kids \n👶 Mini Zones & Family Fun\nFun spaces for you
	nger collectors and first‑time racers — all ages welcome! \n  \n🚨 VENDORS 
	WANTED\nGot STHs\, vintage redlines\, custom builds\, or bulk mainline to 
	move? This is your crowd.\n📥 Apply: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFrom
	Houston \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a special room rate of $79/nigh
	t at TownePlace Suites\, just about 15 minutes from the venue!\n👉 Book: ht
	tps://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=176782396
	7549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \nHunt or race. Trade or just walk the floo
	r. The customs will be parked outside\, the bins will be open inside\, and
	 the track will be running all weekend. See you July 25–26.\n\nhttps://ccs
	-houston.com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-iv/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-iv/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
